    "description": "Senior full-stack developer maintaining 6 enterprise high-traffic Drupal websites for one of the top media companies in the US. Team lead on video and video-related features. Collaborate with cross-functional teams, including designers, project managers, and other developers, to deliver high-quality products that meets the business’s goals and industry standards.\n\n• Team lead on our video product. Successfully migrated the video player from Flash to the PDK player to the React JWPlayer with a strong focus on performance and maintainability.\n\n• Senior full-stack developer building custom Drupal modules, adding new content-types and theming.\n\n• Rebuilt UniversalKids.com decoupled website using NextJS / Drupal 8. Updated the old Unikids front-end from a deprecated electrode React site to NextJS in TypeScript. Modernized the React framework and significantly improved site performance.\n\n• Provided code peer review for both front-end and back-end code to provide feedback on code uniformity, prevent duplication of functionality and adherence to coding standards.\n\n• Significant contribution to a generative AI project using Azure OpenAI apis, OpenAI apis, Python, PostGres vector DB.",
